></span></span></span></span></span></span> 表示缓存折扣系数（OpenAI = 0.1，Anthropic = 0.1）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"实际案例-标价对比-vs-有效成本对比\">实际案例：标价对比 vs 有效成本对比</h3><p>考虑一个代码 Agent 的实际工作负载：8K token 系统 Prompt、400 token 用户输入、600 token 输出、每小时 100 次调用。</p>\n<p><strong>Model A</strong>（轻量模型）：输入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>M</mi><mtext>，输出</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.20/M，输出</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.20/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，输出</span></span></span></span></span>0.80/M，无缓存支持</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每次成本 = 8400 × <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>600</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.20/M + 600 ×</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.20/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">600</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span>0.80/M = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.00168</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.00168 +</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.00168</span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span>0.00048 = <strong>$0.00216</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Model B</strong>（中端模型）：输入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3.00</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>M</mi><mtext>，输出</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3.00/M，输出</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.00/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，输出</span></span></span></span></span>15.00/M，缓存命中率 85%</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每次成本 = 8000 × <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3.00</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>0.10</mn><mtext>（缓存）</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>400</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3.00/M × 0.10（缓存）+ 400 ×</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.00/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.10</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（缓存）</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">400</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span>3.00/M + 600 × $15.00/M</li>\n<li>= <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.0024</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.0024 +</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.0024</span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span>0.0012 + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.009</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>∗</mo><mo>∗</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.009 = **</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.009</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4653em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span></span></span></span></span>0.0126**</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Model B with Batch</strong>（50% 折扣）：= <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.0126</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>∗</mo><mo>∗</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.0126 × 0.5 = **</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.0126</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4653em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span></span></span></span></span>0.0063**</p>\n<p>标价上 Model B 是 Model A 的 15 倍，但有效成本差距仅约 3-6 倍——而 Model B 的质量显著更高。加上 Model A 更高的重试率（指令遵循能力弱），实际差距进一步缩小。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本累积的时间维度\">成本累积的时间维度</h2><p>多轮对话的成本不是线性增长，而是接近二次增长——因为每轮都重新发送全部历史：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对话轮数</th>\n<th>累计输入 token（假设每轮用户 100 + 模型 200）</th>\n<th>相对首轮成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>8,100 (sys + user)</td>\n<td>1x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>9,500</td>\n<td>1.17x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>11,000</td>\n<td>1.36x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>50</td>\n<td>23,000</td>\n<td>2.84x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>38,000</td>\n<td>4.69x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>260</td>\n<td>86,000</td>\n<td>10.6x</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一项实测数据显示：Claude 会话中一个三词用户输入在第 1 条消息花费 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.0018</mn><mtext>，到第</mtext><mn>260</mn><mtext>条消息时花费</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.0018，到第 260 条消息时花费</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.0018</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，到第</span><span class=\"mord\">260</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">条消息时花费</span></span></span></span></span>2.41——膨胀 1339 倍。这是上下文重发机制的直接后果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"token-计数的工程实践\">Token 计数的工程实践</h2><p>准确的 token 计数是所有成本优化的前提。各厂商提供的 tokenizer 工具：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>厂商</th>\n<th>Tokenizer</th>\n<th>获取方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>OpenAI</td>\n<td>tiktoken (cl100k_base / o200k_base)</td>\n<td><code>pip install tiktoken</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Anthropic</td>\n<td>Claude tokenizer</td>\n<td>API 响应的 usage 字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Google</td>\n<td>SentencePiece</td>\n<td>Vertex AI SDK</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通用估算</td>\n<td>1 token ≈ 4 英文字符 ≈ 1.5 中文字符</td>\n<td>粗估公式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import tiktoken&#10;&#10;enc = tiktoken.encoding_for_model(&quot;gpt-4o&quot;)&#10;token_count = len(enc.encode(&quot;Your prompt text here&quot;))&#10;estimated_cost = token_count * price_per_token\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tiktoken</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">enc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tiktoken.encoding_for_model(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gpt-4o\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">token_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(enc.encode(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Your prompt text here\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">estimated_cost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> token_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> price_per_token</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"五条-token-经济学定律\">五条 Token 经济学定律</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>输出比输入贵 3-8 倍</strong> → 控制输出长度是最高杠杆</li>\n<li><strong>缓存把重复输入成本降 90%</strong> → 长系统 Prompt 的高频场景必开缓存</li>\n<li><strong>思考 token 是隐藏账单</strong> → Reasoning 模型的实际成本 = 显示输出 × 5-15</li>\n<li><strong>上下文重发让多轮对话成本接近二次增长</strong> → 滑动窗口/摘要压缩是刚需</li>\n<li><strong>标价排名 ≠ 有效成本排名</strong> → 必须用真实流量回放测有效成本</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Token 经济学的五条定律构成成本优化的理论基础：输出控制 &gt; 输入压缩（因为输出单价 3-8 倍）；Prompt Cache 是长前缀场景的首选手段（降 90%）；Reasoning 模型的思考 token 让实际账单远超预期；多轮对话的二次增长需要主动管理上下文；标价排名不等于有效成本排名——必须用真实流量回放。这五条定律直接指导下一步的成本架构设计。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p>相关文档：<a href=\"cost-architecture\">成本架构</a> 从系统视角分析成本在 API 调用链路中的累积路径与干预点</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Token 经济学","id":"token-经济学"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Token 作为计费原子","id":"token-作为计费原子"},{"level":2,"text":"四种 Token 的定价机制","id":"四种-token-的定价机制"},{"level":3,"text":"输入 Token（Prompt Tokens）","id":"输入-token-prompt-tokens"},{"level":3,"text":"输出 Token（Completion Tokens）","id":"输出-token-completion-tokens"},{"level":3,"text":"缓存 Token（Cached Input Tokens）","id":"缓存-token-cached-input-tokens"},{"level":3,"text":"思考 Token（Thinking Tokens）","id":"思考-token-thinking-tokens"},{"level":2,"text":"有效成本公式","id":"有效成本公式"},{"level":3,"text":"实际案例：标价对比 vs 有效成本对比","id":"实际案例-标价对比-vs-有效成本对比"},{"level":2,"text":"成本累积的时间维度","id":"成本累积的时间维度"},{"level":2,"text":"Token 计数的工程实践","id":"token-计数的工程实践"},{"level":2,"text":"五条 Token 经济学定律","id":"五条-token-经济学定律"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"AI 推理成本全景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/foundations/ai-cost-landscape"},"next":{"title":"成本架构设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/foundations/cost-architecture"}}